      "settings": {
        "checksum": "b0cebd3a9b245a27d625aa18c67ec478ea3370d99555d9fdbfb7dce6bb6bdbd6_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggEV9Gqw5F4_text": "<strong>Most of cats’ dental care are</strong><span style=\"color:#BA352E;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#BA352E;\"><strong>designed to fail.</strong></span>",
        "ggomPVTK3lK_text": "<p>When was the last time you were <strong>ACTUALLY </strong>able to prevent bacteria-buildup in your cat’s teeth and gums? Chances are… <strong>you’re NOT sure</strong>. And that’s because when problems show up (yellow teeth, swollen gums, bad breath), it’s usually when bacteria has <strong>ALREADY SPREAD</strong>. Early on, when the plaque and bacteria builds up – you won’t see them… <strong>YET. </strong>Your best solution is to make sure that it never gets there in the first place.</p>",
        "ggk4i0A7S2y_text": "<p>Prevention is your best option</p>",
        "ggmJ_kIYslM_text": "<span style=\"color:#47B5E9;\"><i>FreshWipes</i></span> &nbsp;vs. \"the other internet solutions\"",
        "ggevVTCj_Gj_text": "<p>FreshWipes</p>",
        "gg-MIMvGcVj_text": "<p><strong>Silvervine Sticks</strong></p>",
        "ggXs__ln_ev_text": "<p>Dental powders &nbsp;&amp; Water additives</p>",
        "ggfUoSanMRY_text": "<p>Removes existing plaque buildup</p>",
        "gg-IuBpUpXd_text": "<p>You control which teeth get cleaned</p>",
        "gge1LmTfUed_text": "<p>You can see it working (proof)</p>",
        "ggFt6X66C2l_text": "<p>Cat actually tolerates it</p>",
        "gg0E19wDNgd_text": "<p>(Can cause vomiting)</p>",
        "ggLraSd0Cf4_text": "<p>No risk of reduced water intake</p>",
        "ggSzxjN6mr-_text": "<p>Cats may drink less (kidney risk)</p>",
        "gg7S-Ps0dUW_text": "<p>How it makes you feel as a dog owner:</p>",
        "ggA5sYFFmhT_text": "<p>😊😌 ✅</p>",
        "ggnxoRgwUs6_text": "<p>😖😩</p>",
        "ggC4NtyLJqF_text": "<p>😕🤷‍♀️</p>"
      }
    },
    "gp_section_610898799686189867": {
      "type": "gp-section-610898799686189867",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "2d471813da9113ade4499920104cd447560de272bf52551f1aa724fb8344233d_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggPTQ4b2Oyp_text": "<strong>Dental Problems&nbsp;</strong><br><span style=\"color:#BA352E;\"><strong>Start Hidden.</strong></span>",
        "ggUD4YdXUjF_text": "<p>If you notice <strong>yellow teeth, red, swollen gums, and bad breath</strong> – it usually means bacteria has already spread – and it <strong>SPREADS FAST</strong>.</p><p>Left untreated, this can cause inflammation, gum disease, tooth loss and costly vet visits later on.</p>",
        "gg7zWXq-7qs_text": "<p><i><strong>80% of cats show signs of dental disease by age 3.</strong></i></p>"
      }
    },
