        "ggju8zInVTd_text": "<strong>So we built the ideal solution that defines what&nbsp;</strong><br><span style=\"color:#47B5E9;\"><strong>‘Cat Dental Care’ SHOULD mean.</strong></span>",
        "ggEllCIZG91_text": "<p>We designed a wipe that uses anti-bacterial ingredients to “wipe out” plaque and bacteria effortlessly. This means no more bacteria regrowth… No more bacteria buildup… A formula that cats ACTUALLY welcome so you won’t have to deal with them biting and scratching.</p><p><strong>A formula that delivers the Fresher Breath and Brighter Teeth your cat deserves.</strong></p>"
      }
